  "description": "Embark on a teeming 4.2-km out-and-back journey along the delightful Duiwe River. This quick and easy trail, typically completed in about 1 hour and 20 minutes, invites adventurers on a short and sweet stroll along the stream. Meandering across the river on well-crafted crossings, the path leads to a little rockpool waterfall - a refreshing haven at the trail's end. While beloved by many wonderful wanderers, moments of quiet solitude still await those who venture during the trail's calmer hours.",
